WEBVTT

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:44.000
I hate you

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:29.800
Once upon a time, about a week ago, in a country far, far away...

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.820
There was a pet shop in a town where there were no children.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:39.190
Yes, it was about a week ago.

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:45.440
How long are you going to travel this time?

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:49.860
Hmm, it's the wind that's flowing between the white bears in Alaska.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.910
I don't think it's that easy to fix.

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:57.060
Yes, I've prepared an electric toothbrush battery for two months.

00:01:58.360 --> 00:01:59.980
Azarashi's electric...

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.700
I'd like to bring an electric toothbrush, too, but...

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:03.100
I don't have one.

00:02:05.690 --> 00:02:07.480
I'm sorry about everything.

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:08.480
It's nothing.

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:11.700
But I'm getting lonely.

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:14.580
I'm in 10th place.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:16.100
I have to go if I have to.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.000
That's right.

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.700
It's for the animals all over the world.

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:20.820
It can't be helped.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:22.740
But...

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:25.920
At least we have children.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:29.250
Our children are animals.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:32.980
Think of animals as your own children.

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:36.300
That's right, Mama.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:31.200
It's a death note!

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:41.330
It's a death note!

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:44.210
I don't want to appear in the 20th century anymore.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:45.770
It's a death note!

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:49.820
Those who cry in this world!

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:52.700
Those who have a small heart in sadness!

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:55.050
I am here!

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:58.650
I am the warrior of justice, the warrior of love!

00:03:59.190 --> 00:03:59.900
Mon-chan!

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:09.260
Isn't it pretty?

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:15.040
Isn't it pretty?

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:20.000
Which one is cuter?

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:26.020
Tome's Chi-Chi Pappa Megan

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:33.020
The moon is out, too.

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:35.290
From tomorrow, we'll be the children of this house.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:36.690
Let's be quiet.

00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:38.840
I don't want to sleep in a doghouse.

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:40.700
It's okay.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:41.660
Come here.

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:53.220
It's better than a doghouse.

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:55.960
I have to get up early tomorrow.

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:58.440
Well, good night.

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:02.210
I'm going back to my house.

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:06.560
Oh, you're going to sleep well.

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:08.590
That's a good thing.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:10.150
Yofukashi is the enemy of beauty.

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:12.150
Now, let's go to bed.

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:25.460
Momo, wake up.

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:27.320
This morning, I'm going to go to Alaska.

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:35.660
Okay.

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:46.960
I wonder if I've seen that room before.

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:49.630
I've seen it, haven't I?

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:55.220
Momo, it's been a while since we last met, but I asked you to take care of Mama.

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:58.800
Okay, put it back on.

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:00.660
Leave it to me.

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:01.620
Mama, bye.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:02.580
Be careful.

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:03.500
Huh?

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:10.020
Is she my daughter?

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:11.740
Daughter?

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:16.140
Well, I guess so.

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:18.280
I'm sure it's her.

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:23.490
Let's open the shop.

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:24.310
Yes, Mama.

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:26.460
I'm so into this girl.

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:28.230
Of course.

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:29.390
The power of magic.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.320
That's perfect!

00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:33.000
Excuse me!

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:34.060
Welcome!

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:35.980
Excuse me!

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:37.320
Who is the doctor who will cure the animal's disease?

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:40.300
The doctor who will cure the animal's disease?

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:41.930
Yes. It's my father.

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:46.080
The horse called Hero Symboly in our ranch is sick.

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:47.100
Mom.

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:48.850
I'm in trouble.

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:50.470
My father won't come back for a month.

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:52.420
Is that so?

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:54.840
I heard that the doctor here will cure it.

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:58.560
But there are many nurses who can only cure the doctor here.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:02.440
I'll do it!

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:03.900
You'll do it?

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:05.720
I'm papa's daughter.

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:08.340
I'm sure I can cure the disease of animals.

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:09.440
That's right.

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:10.320
That's right.

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:12.100
You're our only daughter.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:13.600
I'm sure you'll be fine.

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:14.460
Yeah.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:15.830
I'll do it!

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:17.070
Sweet pot!

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:17.590
Beer!

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:18.630
Work!

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.000
Gourmet pop!

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:06.780
It's Gachon Symboly, the brother of the sick Hero Symboly, but he can't become a human.

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:15.690
I'm the one who told you to call me! What can a little girl like me do?

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:19.040
But she's your daughter.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:20.640
Because she's my daughter?

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:27.960
Listen. I showed this Hero Symboly to the doctors in the town.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:29.720
The horse that was thrown away...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.390
I can't be cured by a little girl like you!

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:37.480
Why? Do you think I can't cure you?

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.160
You're just a child!

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:40.980
You're not a child's doctor!

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:45.080
I'm so disappointed!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.100
It seems that the Hero Symbol will appear in the Fire Show in despair.

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:06.110
Mr. Walder, please wait a little longer.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:11.300
No, your ranch's debt is piled up.

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:16.920
As long as you don't win the next Fire Show and get the prize, your ranch is mine.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:22.920
It's a common story. That old man is trying to take over this ranch.

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:34.360
This is the end of the story, isn't it?

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:37.200
The fire show is a gift from my brother.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:40.160
And I'll give you a present.

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:55.100
I can't do anything for children.

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:56.770
That's what I'm thinking.

00:09:57.690 --> 00:09:58.480
You're so rude.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.340
If that's the case, let's grow up!

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:08.040
That's right! That's right!

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:10.330
I'll give you a magic wand for that!

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:11.560
Try using it!

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.800
Dear, our daughter is doing her best.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:17.370
Why don't you take a look at her a little more?

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:19.870
Of course, I'll try to do it!

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:22.750
It's been two thousand years since I've been with you.

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:24.170
I still don't understand.

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:27.170
What kind of personality do you have?

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:32.460
Shut up, shut up, shut up! Let's move on!

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:36.120
That's right! If you can't be a child, you should become an adult!

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:38.710
That's right! Become an adult!

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.500
Very well, very well! I'll do it!

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:44.150
I want to be popular!

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:08.990
Are you ready?

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:12.580
Thank you, friends.

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:29.650
My grandmother was surprised, but if I come here,

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:29.970
we'll be right back.

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:31.260
Who are you?

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:32.260
I'm a member of the pet shop.

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:34.800
I can cure any animal's disease.

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:37.120
No, let me show you.

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:39.020
Then I'll be your assistant.

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:40.040
Assistant?

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:42.450
That's not a kind name.

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:47.160
It's more like one arm, or both arms.

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:51.060
Anyway, without me, you can't cure animal diseases.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.800
Then, I'll be your assistant.

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:58.910
Here you go.

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:10.770
Oh, right! That's him! He must have done it!

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:12.350
Will it heal?

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:14.470
Leave it to me.

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:16.810
Just one injection will heal you right away.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:24.330
Of course!

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:26.100
You're a good doctor.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:27.960
If you can get through it, you're the best.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:29.760
What are you talking about?

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:34.480
Do you think we'll make it to the fire station in four days?

00:12:35.260 --> 00:12:36.300
Four days?

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:37.430
That's impossible.

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:40.110
We won't be able to recover in four days.

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:41.350
Besides...

00:12:41.350 --> 00:12:42.990
Then nothing will happen!

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:44.120
It's no good!

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:44.900
It's despair!

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:53.230
I don't understand what you're saying, Pipiru.

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:54.310
I'll translate it for you.

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:55.230
Yes, sir!

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:02.880
Wait a minute, Mr. Yohan.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:04.590
Yes, yes.

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:06.090
What?

00:13:07.130 --> 00:13:08.590
My little brother can win.

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:11.810
Use my little brother's Gachon Symbol instead of me.

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.160
Is that what you said?

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:13.840
Yes!

00:13:14.650 --> 00:13:16.480
Don't worry.

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:17.920
Leave the rest to my little sister.

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:19.240
What?

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:19.880
Bye!

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:30.960
I don't like it here.

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:34.640
I'm sorry for running around with people like my brother.

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:38.880
But it's a chance to be a hero.

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:43.560
There are so many heroes.

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:46.800
At least I don't have a thick eye like this.

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:49.240
Oh, that's...

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:26.700
Thank you for watching!

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:42.930
The reality is, it's a tough one.

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:52.390
You think you can beat me with that?

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:03.490
Thank you.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.940
It's a lie, it's a lie!

00:15:32.020 --> 00:15:49.970
W-W-WHAT?!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.700
I'm your lover! It's a lie!

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:06.090
No way! No, but if that's the case, don't put that horse in the race!

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:07.550
Hey!

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:09.330
Hey!

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:13.030
Shinmari!

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:16.680
This is bad! The base is too unknown!

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:18.260
What?

00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:18.880
What?

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:32.240
No way! I've never ridden a horse before!

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:34.350
But...

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:36.640
I've ridden a Pegasus with wings.

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:40.110
A real horse shouldn't be like a Pegasus.

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:42.090
Stop it, stop it.

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:43.270
I see...

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.550
That's right!

00:16:46.530 --> 00:16:48.100
I'm going to be a female jockey!

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:52.950
I see.

00:16:53.730 --> 00:16:54.430
All right.

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:56.150
I'll show you how good I am at this.

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:57.650
All right.

00:16:57.800 --> 00:16:58.320
Let's do it!

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:29.980
Hehehe, God told you she would

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:32.320
I'm going to get rid of the jockey and get out of here!

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:33.800
I'm going to get rid of the jockey and get out of here!

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:35.880
Fire Show, start the obstacle course!

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:00.630
What are you talking about?

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:01.820
Don't get carried away!

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:03.690
Alright!

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:06.640
The rest of you are under my control!

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:07.880
Win or lose,

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:09.260
stop them with all your might!

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:42.900
Uh...

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:43.040
Oh!

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:07.430
It's a way to protect yourself.

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:16.050
What do you think?

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:18.150
I can't fly!

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:20.090
What if I lose my weight?

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:03.380
The first and the second match will be a photo test.

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:11.920
The first match will be a gachun-shinbori with the difference in the tongue.

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:17.220
Oh, that's great!

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:18.760
You did a good job!

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:20.700
What is it?

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:26.320
He decided to go with Nihiru despite being a horse.

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:28.160
It's like he's lying when he's fat.

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:32.600
Gachan, be careful.

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:44.660
Gari, Gari, Gari.

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:48.630
No good!

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:49.690
Did you forget?

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:52.460
If Momo's pendant doesn't shine four times,

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:54.920
the jewel won't fit in there.

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:56.440
Y-Y-Yes, it's true.

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:58.940
And there are twelve jewels.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:03.220
If we don't gather 12 of them, we won't be able to achieve our goal.

00:21:03.676 --> 00:21:05.176
Will Momo be able to do it?

00:21:05.244 --> 00:21:07.584
Well, this time, I've gotten used to it.

00:21:07.584 --> 00:21:10.184
Eidaba, eidaba, eidabasa!

00:21:10.364 --> 00:21:12.364
Thank you for watching!

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:39.710
I don't know what to do, but my dreams are crumbling

00:22:11.228 --> 00:22:12.868
Was my debut decided?

00:22:13.276 --> 00:22:15.876
But when I grow up, I feel so happy.

00:22:16.188 --> 00:22:17.848
What would you be if you were an adult?

00:22:18.076 --> 00:22:19.316
Teach me, please!

00:22:19.484 --> 00:22:21.084
Let me hear your dreams too!

00:22:21.692 --> 00:22:22.372
Well then!

00:22:22.428 --> 00:22:23.328
Next time...

00:22:23.356 --> 00:22:26.616
It's the appearance of a puppy who wants to become a human.

00:22:26.940 --> 00:22:29.600
And I'm going to challenge myself to be the top model.

00:22:30.028 --> 00:22:34.208
Next time on Magic Princess Minky Momo! Charm Up With Glasses!

00:22:34.476 --> 00:22:35.716
Please look forward to it!
